<title>POLAND: Budimex wins PLN 33 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex wins PLN 33 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish builder Budimex SA has signed a 33-million-zloty contract with a Polish subsidiary of Hannover-based BSV Bauservice und Verwaltung GmbH, Budimex said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Budimex said its construction of a shopping centre in Rybnik, southern Poland, would last from July this year until February 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
